## Booking and Service Area

Our services focus on Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros. There is no fixed booking window, only availability, so reach out once your date and venue are confirmed. See our [booking timeline](/blog/timeline-for-booking-wedding-rentals/) guide for more on that.

## Conclusion

The honest trend picture from MEG's side of a wedding isn't a decor palette or a furniture style, it's a booking pattern: more couples choosing the technician included [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), wireless microphones going from extra to expected, and a real, deliberate choice between warm static light and color changing accents. That's the trend we can actually speak to. [Contact us](/contact/) to check availability for your date.

## FAQs

### What is actually trending in wedding rentals right now?

Most "wedding rental trend" content covers decor, tablescapes, and catering, none of which MEG offers. On our own AV side, the real pattern is more couples booking the technician included Wedding Pack over a self run setup, and wireless microphones becoming a default expectation for reception speeches rather than a special request.

### Is a live wedding AV technician a standard trend now, or still optional?

It depends on the package. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and the full MICE Pack include a live technician on site throughout the event. The Basic MICE Pack does not include one by default, but it can be added from 240 euros per day. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) is delivered and tested by our crew, then run without a technician for the rest of the event. See our [making the most of your wedding rentals](/blog/making-the-most-of-wedding-rentals/) guide for how to brief the technician once you've booked.

### Are couples choosing warm static lighting or color changing lighting more often for weddings?

Both, depending on guest count and the look they want. The Wedding Pack's fairy lights give a fixed warm glow for up to 80 guests. The Eco Pack's RGBW spotlights give color changing accents for up to 50 guests. Neither is a default over the other. Our [lighting ideas for wedding rentals](/blog/lighting-ideas-for-wedding-rentals/) guide has the full comparison.

### Does Malaga Event Gear offer an eco friendly or sustainable rental option?

The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) is our smallest, simplest setup, two speakers, one microphone, two light bars, self run after our crew delivers and tests it. It's a genuinely smaller footprint installation for smaller events, but it is not a certified sustainability program, and we don't market it as one.

### What equipment brands does MEG use for wedding AV rentals?

We use premium professional brands trusted in the live event industry, including Shure, QSC, and Martin, across both the Wedding Pack and the Eco Pack, to ensure reliable, high fidelity sound and lighting performance.
